grade its own code.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
One request. A disposable cart.
Add a clear help example.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Start needs my Touch ID.
Bound to this exact request.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
No internet. Secrets blocked.
Latest probe: 76 protected paths denied.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
