New behavior is not independently proved.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The Builder can’t read
or change the judge.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
New tests only count if they fail
on old code and pass on new code.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
12 planted cheats. 0 passed.
5 failed. 7 stayed inconclusive.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
