A fake passing test did not win.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Ready for review. Not checked.
Accept stays locked.

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
One help-text change.
No Accept or Reject was pressed.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
This verdict is signed
by my Mac’s security chip.

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,000
AI does the work.
Nothing fools the check.
